# Everything the image does not run. Without this the build context carries the
# test suite, the caches and — worse — a local `.env`, which would then sit in a
# layer of the published image.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

**/tests/
docs/
scripts/
.github/

**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

requirements-dev.txt
AUDIT_LOG.md
